WEBVTT

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.042
It's the only way
they can differentiate themselves,

00:07:02.042 --> 00:07:03.919
using data to improve.

00:07:03.961 --> 00:07:07.256
This is exactly the same as esports.

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:10.926
There are team managers,
there are coaches, even psychologists,

00:07:10.926 --> 00:07:13.304
but most importantly, data analysts.

00:07:14.013 --> 00:07:17.349
In the racing game, the PC game,

00:07:17.391 --> 00:07:22.480
they hit out around 300
different data points in real time

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.899
for you to analyze
and improve what you do.

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:26.108
Not real F1.

00:07:26.108 --> 00:07:27.443
This is the game.

00:07:27.485 --> 00:07:31.280
Things like tire temperature,
brakes, acceleration,